us studio album. In South Korean television, Song gained fame as a cast member of We Got Married and Invincible Youth. She has also acted in various Chinese drama series such as When Love Walked In (2012), Beautiful Secret (2015), Ice Fantasy (2016), A Life Time Love (2017), Moonshine and Valentine (2018), Find Yourself (2020); and the films My New Sassy Girl (2016), My Best Friend's Wedding (2016), and Wished (2017).","title":"Victoria Song","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Victoria_Song"},"positions":["Leader","Main dancer","Sub vocalist"],"factSources":{"positions":{"name":"Namu Wiki (2021 dump)","license":"CC BY-NC-SA 2.0 KR","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/2.0/kr/","base":"https://namu.wiki/w/","url":"https://namu.wiki/w/%EB%B9%85%ED%86%A0%EB%A6%AC%EC%95%84%28f%28x%29%29"}}},"Q380123":{"id":"Q380123","name":"Kim Hee-chul","ko":"김희철","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1983-07-10","death":"","birthplace":"Hoengseong County","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["actor","singer","film actor","television presenter","drummer","songwriter"],"debut":"2005","agencies":[{"name":"SM Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q483938","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q239693","name":"Super Junior","start":"2005","end":""},{"id":"Q10788934","name":"M&D","start":"2011","end":"2019"},{"id":"Q2625142","name":"Super Junior-T","start":"","end":""},{"id":"Q140936337","name":"Super Junior-83z","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/kimheenim/","x":"https://x.com/Heedictator","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCr-S42f8J5IBLiU4AuMdO-Q","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/7GbN8yzIP7CFK5bNbUi6L3","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/3d05dd13-f524-4e80-91aa-24094e8b5928"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Kim Hee-chul, better known mononymously as Heechul, is a South Korean singer-songwriter, rapper, presenter, and actor. He is a member of the South Korean boy band Super Junior and has further participated in its subgroups Super Junior-T and is the leader of subgroup Super Junior-83z, as well as a member of project groups Universe Cowards with Min Kyung-hoon and Woojoo jjokkomi with Lee Soo-geun. He was also a member of the disbanded pop rock duo Kim Heechul & Kim Jungmo. Prior to his debut in Super Junior, Heechul began his acting career in 2005, starring in the second season of teen drama Sharp 2.","title":"Kim Hee-chul","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kim_Hee-chul"},"positions":["Sub vocalist","Sub rapper"],"factSources":{"positions":{"name":"Namu Wiki (2021 dump)","license":"CC BY-NC-SA 2.0 KR","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/2.0/kr/","base":"https://namu.wiki/w/","url":"https://namu.wiki/w/%ED%9D%AC%EC%B2%A0"}}},"Q47506267":{"id":"Q47506267","name":"Hana","ko":"이지애","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Lee Ji Ae"],"birth":"1986-08-06","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"","agencies":[],"groups":[],"links":{},"photo":null,"bio":null},"Q484187":{"id":"Q484187","name":"Seo In-young","ko":"서인영","birthName":"","birthNameEn":"","aliases":[],"birth":"1984-09-03","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","dancer","actor","model"],"debut":"2002","agencies":[{"name":"Star Empire Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q3206859","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q490873","name":"Jewelry","start":"2002","end":"2010"}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/seoinza/","x":"https://x.com/iycompany","spotify":"https://open.spotify.com/artist/6UaKk8mT8NH0BuUTFIhxN7","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/a5524b66-e7d2-47cd-98ad-31ba53d9d9fd"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Seo In-young, also known as Elly, is a South Korean singer, dancer, model, television host, and actress. She was a member of girl group Jewelry and featured on the reality show We Got Marr